    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your own pirate crew and tame Decklings as you explore the uncharted islands in this card management deck-building game. Collect resources, craft recipes, and train your Decklings to engage in challenging card-based battles to become the Pirate Champion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715790/extras/e8fcf8051fa1f8ccf9b80c9d8e3f6395.avif?t=1754945588\" width=616 height=156 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore over 100 procedurally generated islands with diverse biomes, resources, and unique Decklings to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tame wild Decklings to grow your collection, featuring over 100 unique creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Deckling has unique abilities and move sets that can be learned as they level up</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your Decklings to learn new moves or upgrade existing ones to enhance their decks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728Hunt rare holo Decklings scattered across the map</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715790/extras/1e35f42811d33a5a940459b48fc7609b.avif?t=1754945588\" width=616 height=156 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle pirate crews in 3x3 card duels on your path to becoming the Pirate Champion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try different team combinations and explore their synergies to defeat your foes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat pirate captains and collect their Jolly Rogers as you rise through the ranks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your base against pirate invasions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715790/extras/b811e486e0e68675d0bf88b9fa6b0062.avif?t=1754945588\" width=616 height=156 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack cards to craft all sorts of items including food, equipment, and stations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn new recipes from Drafts you find along your journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft equipment and items to get special bonuses and buffs in battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed your Decklings to keep the crew together, or they might run away</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build plantation fields, logging sites, and other stations to improve your base</p></li></ul>",
