b_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715790/extras/b811e486e0e68675d0bf88b9fa6b0062.avif?t=1754945588\" width=616 height=156 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack cards to craft all sorts of items including food, equipment, and stations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn new recipes from Drafts you find along your journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft equipment and items to get special bonuses and buffs in battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed your Decklings to keep the crew together, or they might run away</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build plantation fields, logging sites, and other stations to improve your base</p></li></ul>",
